    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Lady Malys",
    "summary": "During [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or [either player's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), as this model's unit is **selected to shoot** or **selected to fight**, you can Empower that unit by paying a [Pain token](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain). If you do, pick **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)** or **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)**. While the unit remains Empowered, its models' weapons get the picked ability, for the rest of the phase.",
